  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AndE Mamma Used Paper Recycling and Upcycling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses to solve the socio -economic challenges of disadvantaged women living in extreme poverty in Addis Ababa and surrounding regions where basics like food, safe drinking water, sanitation, healthcare, and housing are even outright unattainable. The enterprise empowers home -based women by providing marketable handcrafting skills training that enables them to produce quality home -based handicraft products and generate their own income. In addition, the enterprise will plan for the next five years to attain substantially increase used paper collection capacity and consolidate production and export of used paper -made decorative packaging/promotional products and reach a target annual revenue of GBP6,705,015.00.</narrative>
  </description>
